WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.882
Wukong shouted outside the cave.

2
00:00:02.883 --> 00:00:07.624
He shouted all kinds of insults about the Demon of Power.

3
00:00:07.625 --> 00:00:10.481
Inside the cave the guard woke up.

4
00:00:10.482 --> 00:00:14.271
He ran to the demon's bedroom.

5
00:00:14.272 --> 00:00:20.678
"Master!" cried the guard. "The monkey is back!"

6
00:00:20.679 --> 00:00:23.736
[g@"It's the middle of the night," said the demon.

7
00:00:23.737 --> 00:00:25.946
"What does he want?"@g]

8
00:00:25.947 --> 00:00:29.322
"He said we must return the queen," said the guard.

9
00:00:29.323 --> 00:00:32.697
"If we don't, he'll smash our entire mountain.

10
00:00:32.698 --> 00:00:37.525
He also yelled some terrible things about you."

11
00:00:37.526 --> 00:00:41.731
The Demon of Power climbed out of bed and grabbed the fake bells.

12
00:00:41.732 --> 00:00:47.059
"I'll chase the monkey away with my fire, smoke, and sand again."

13
00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:52.091
He tied the bells around his neck and went outside.

14
00:00:52.092 --> 00:00:54.348
[g@The demon glared at Wukong.

15
00:00:54.349 --> 00:00:58.138
"Go away! I'm sleeping!"@g]

16
00:00:58.139 --> 00:01:01.942
"Return the queen!" shouted the monkey.

17
00:01:01.943 --> 00:01:04.498
[g@"Never!" said the demon.

18
00:01:04.499 --> 00:01:07.045
He reached for the bells around his neck.@g]

19
00:01:07.046 --> 00:01:09.956
Wukong pretended to be surprised.

20
00:01:09.957 --> 00:01:15.232
"Oh," he said. "I have bells just like those."

21
00:01:15.233 --> 00:01:17.822
The demon squinted at the monkey.

22
00:01:17.823 --> 00:01:20.901
[g@"I doubt your bells are like mine.

23
00:01:20.902 --> 00:01:23.577
Let me see them."@g]

24
00:01:23.578 --> 00:01:26.713
[g@Wukong held up the bells.

25
00:01:26.714 --> 00:01:29.372
The demon peered at them for a moment.@g]

26
00:01:29.373 --> 00:01:33.001
[g@"Those bells do look like mine.

27
00:01:33.002 --> 00:01:36.592
But my bells are magic."@g]

28
00:01:36.593 --> 00:01:40.539
"So are mine," said Wukong.

29
00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:47.805
"My bells can make fire, smoke, and sand," said the demon.

30
00:01:47.806 --> 00:01:50.609
[g@"That's interesting." Wukong smiled.

31
00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:53.139
"My bells can do that too."@g]

32
00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:58.030
"Really?" The Demon of Power looked surprised.

33
00:01:58.031 --> 00:02:02.165
"Let's compare bells to see whose work better."

34
00:02:02.166 --> 00:02:06.976
"Okay," said Wukong. "You go first."

35
00:02:06.977 --> 00:02:10.322
[g@"I was planning to," said the demon.

36
00:02:10.323 --> 00:02:13.901
He shook his bells.

37
00:02:13.902 --> 00:02:17.747
Nothing happened.@g]

38
00:02:17.748 --> 00:02:20.351
[g@He shook the bells again.

39
00:02:20.352 --> 00:02:23.196
Again nothing happened.@g]

40
00:02:23.197 --> 00:02:26.133
[g@"That's strange," the demon mumbled.

41
00:02:26.134 --> 00:02:28.849
He looked closely at the bells.@g]

42
00:02:28.850 --> 00:02:34.058
"These bells worked fine yesterday."

43
00:02:34.059 --> 00:02:36.747
[g@Wukong tried not to laugh.

44
00:02:36.748 --> 00:02:39.982
"Let's see if my bells work," he said.@g]

45
00:02:39.983 --> 00:02:44.061
The monkey shook the bells.

46
00:02:44.062 --> 00:02:49.254
[i@Whoosh!@i] Fire, smoke, and sand rushed toward the demon.

47
00:02:49.255 --> 00:02:52.689
[g@"Aargh!" cried the demon.

48
00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:55.578
He covered his face and fell to the ground.@g]

49
00:02:55.579 --> 00:03:00.074
Wukong pulled out his iron bar and got ready to strike.

50
00:03:00.075 --> 00:03:03.551
"Wukong, stop!" shouted a voice.

51
00:03:03.552 --> 00:03:09.162
The monkey looked up and saw Guanyin coming down from the sky.

52
00:03:09.163 --> 00:03:12.687
Wukong bowed. "Greetings, Bodhisattva.

53
00:03:12.688 --> 00:03:15.722
I was just going to destroy this demon."

54
00:03:15.723 --> 00:03:19.370
"You must not harm him," said Guanyin.

55
00:03:19.371 --> 00:03:20.968
[g@"He's my pet wolf.

56
00:03:20.969 --> 00:03:23.267
He escaped from Heaven."@g]

57
00:03:23.268 --> 00:03:25.991
[g@The bodhisattva looked at the demon.

58
00:03:25.992 --> 00:03:28.772
"Return to your true form!"@g]

59
00:03:28.773 --> 00:03:34.318
Light sparkled, and the demon turned into a huge wolf.

60
00:03:34.319 --> 00:03:38.013
Guanyin climbed onto the wolf's back.

61
00:03:38.014 --> 00:03:41.461
She looked at the wolf's neck and then at Wukong.

62
00:03:41.462 --> 00:03:44.642
"Give me the bells, Wukong."

63
00:03:44.643 --> 00:03:50.103
"What bells?" Wukong held the bells behind his back.

64
00:03:50.104 --> 00:03:54.278
"My wolf wears a set of three bells," said Guanyin.

65
00:03:54.279 --> 00:03:55.882
[g@"I know you have them.

66
00:03:55.883 --> 00:03:58.955
You could not have defeated the wolf without them."@g]

67
00:03:58.956 --> 00:04:03.079
Wukong shrugged. "I have no idea what you're—"

68
00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:06.110
[g@"Hand them over," said Guanyin.

69
00:04:06.111 --> 00:04:10.615
"Or I'll recite the Tight Headband spell."@g]

70
00:04:10.616 --> 00:04:13.574
[g@"There's no need for that!" cried the monkey.

71
00:04:13.575 --> 00:04:15.432
"I was just joking!"@g]

72
00:04:15.433 --> 00:04:18.855
Grinning sheepishly, he handed over the bells.

73
00:04:18.856 --> 00:04:28.443
Guanyin tied the bells around the wolf's neck and then rode up into the sky.

74
00:04:28.444 --> 00:04:32.575
Back at the palace, the king and queen were reunited.

75
00:04:32.576 --> 00:04:38.061
"Thank you for rescuing the queen, Sun Wukong," said the king.

76
00:04:38.062 --> 00:04:44.993
"Tonight we will hold a feast to thank you and your companions," said the queen.

77
00:04:44.994 --> 00:04:49.260
That night the royal banquet hall was filled with people.

78
00:04:49.261 --> 00:04:58.908
Servants carried trays filled with rice, vegetables, mushrooms, noodles, tofu, dumplings, and other food.

79
00:04:58.909 --> 00:05:03.579
Bajie ate everything in front of him.

80
00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:08.150
"Would you like more steamed buns?" asked a servant.

81
00:05:08.151 --> 00:05:11.207
"You don't need to ask," said the pig.

82
00:05:11.208 --> 00:05:20.260
"Just put food in front of me, and I'll eat it!"

